<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3 Johan</book>
  <para style="h">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="mt">3 Johan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kawhhran upa keimah in ka duhdawt zetmi Gaius na hnenah hi ca hi ka lo kuat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka duhdawtmi ka rual, thlarau lamah damte in na um ti ka theih vekin ziang hmuahhmuahah harhdam le siarem ih na umnak dingah na hrangah thla ka cam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang cu thutak sungah a um ringringmi na si bangtuk in thutak ah taimakin na um hrih ti thu Khristian unau pawl in in ra sim ih ka lung a awi ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka faale pawl thutak sungah an nungcang ti ka theih hnakih ka lung i awitertu thu dang a um nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka duhdawtmi ka rual, na Khristian unau hrang hna na ṭuan tikah, na theih dah lomi an si hmanah rin um zetin na ṭuan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Duhdawtnak na neih zia cu hi tawk kawhhran hnenah an ra rel zo. Hmailam an feh hrihnak ding lamzin khalah Pathian lungtong zawng in rak bawm hrih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ziangahtile Khrih hnaṭuannak an lamzin an rak thok tikah zum lotu pawl hnen ihsin bomnak ziang hman la loin Khrih hnaṭuan an rak thok a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah thutak sungih an hnaṭuannak sungah kannih khal kan tel venak dingah kannih Khristian pawl in napi in kan bawm pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kawhhran hnenah ca tawite ka ngan; asinain an hotu si a duhtu Diotrefes cun ka simmi cu ziang hmanah a siar lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah ka ra thlen tikah a tuahmi hmuahhmuah ka phuang thluh ding; kan thuhla siazet ih a relmi le thuphan a permi pawl ka langter ṭheh ding. Culawng a si hrih lo. Khristian unau pawl an ra tlawn tikah thlen-inn a on duh lo ih thlen-inn on a duhtu pawl hman kha a kham ih cupawl cu kawhhran sung ihsin phuar dingah a zuam ciamco a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka duhdawtmi ka rual, a ṭha lomi kha cawng hlah aw; a ṭhami cawng sawn aw. A ṭhami a tuahtu cu Pathian ta a si, a ṭha lomi a tuahtu cun Pathian a hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zozo khal in Demetrias an lawm; thutak hrimhrim khal in a lawm a si. Kanmah khal in cumi cu kan theihpi vemi a si ih kan simmi cu a dikmi a si ti na thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thu lo sim ding tamzet ka nei, asinain cafung le cati thawn cun ngan ka duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lo tlawn cing ka tum ih cunah hmaitonin ka lo sim leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Daihnak na parah um hram seh. Na rualpi pawl in cibai an lo buk. Kan rualpi pawl kha pumpak ciar in cibai in rak buksak aw.
  </para>
</usx>
